WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,520
Her song is so flawless

2
00:00:01,960 --> 00:00:03,680
Everyone is feeling severe discomfort

3
00:00:04,240 --> 00:00:05,720
I can't see anything with my eyes

4
00:00:06,160 --> 00:00:07,760
My hands and feet feel completely frozen

5
00:00:08,240 --> 00:00:10,720
She obviously knew that Song Ci and Lulu were being beaten in front of them.

6
00:00:11,040 --> 00:00:12,320
But there's nothing I can do to help

7
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:19,940
I can only be a living person waiting to die.

8
00:00:20,260 --> 00:00:26,240
I won't let you get close to me

9
00:00:26,600 --> 00:00:28,440
The base of capable people is your end

10
00:00:28,720 --> 00:00:29,840
You should be more awake

11
00:00:30,120 --> 00:00:40,790
A guy who usually has such a venomous mouth

12
00:00:41,230 --> 00:00:42,710
He would fight to the death to protect me

13
00:00:43,030 --> 00:00:44,670
There was a lot of blood left
